```

#### `clsx/lite`
> **Size (gzip):** 140 bytes<br>
> **Availability:** CommonJS, ES Module<br>
> **CAUTION:** Accepts **ONLY** string arguments!

Ideal for applications that ***only*** use the string-builder pattern.

